      "answer": "The approved live patch window for Verdant Bay is March 24, 2026, from 02:00 to 04:00 local time. If the validation checks fail during the live patch, the rollback procedure is to run the command `orchestrator rollback --target ruleset=<prior_sha>`, which rehydrates the prior ruleset and replays the invalidation hook. After rollback, the steps include notifying Verdant Bay, opening an incident for manual remediation, and reverting any partial replays to ensure system consistency [art_fff67d92fe41].",
