      "answer": "Among the North America West Event Nexus accounts, the ones dealing with taxonomy/search semantics problems are Arcadia Cloudworks, BlueHarbor Logistics, CedarWind Renewables, HelioFab Systems, Pacific Health Network, and Pioneer Freight Solutions. The accounts dealing with duplicate-action problems are Helix Assemblies Inc., LedgerBright Analytics, LedgerPeak Software, MedLogix Distribution, Peregrine Logistics Group, and Pioneer Grid Retail LLC. This list covers all 12 accounts in the North America West cohort as per the trusted metadata indicating complete and authoritative coverage of these accounts [art_90991e25335f, art_8b0063fbb3cb, art_10f7e8b72e09, art_9345d5653840, art_0ac4efa5a0ff, art_8478ccd5b200, art_2f780acc1f96, art_87b096c2c2d3, art_4eccfd9dcf29, art_0927b1cbb7f4, art_3ba29fe1e026, art_f64972a66eeb].",
